{'symbol': 'ULTA', 'date': '2022-06-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'ULTA BEAUTY LAUNCHES MUSE ACCELERATOR PROGRAM FOCUSED ON EARLY-STAGE BIPOC BRANDS', 'text': "BOLINGBROOK, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ULTA BEAUTY, THE NATION'S LARGEST BEAUTY RETAILER, IS NOW ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS FOR ITS MUSE ACCELERATOR, ITS INAUGURAL PROGRAM DEDICATED TO SUPPORTING EARLY-STAGE BIPOC BEAUTY BRANDS TO LAUNCH AND THRIVE IN RETAIL. THROUGH THE MUSE ACCELERATOR, ULTA BEAUTY WILL EDUCATE, INSPIRE AND SUPPORT PARTICIPANTS WITH TIME, RESOURCES AND MENTORSHIP TO PREPARE DIVERSE LEADERS, FOUNDERS AND ENTREPRENEURS FOR RETAIL READINESS, WHILE NURTURING A COMMUNITY TO HELP EMPOWER"}